# The menu of the right button with the Tag submenu beside it.
Set Width 1584
Set Height 800
Source "docs/tapes/ambiente.tape"
Output "docs/media/.scarto/tag-menu.gif"
Type "RADA_DEMO_DEST=$HOME/Documenti rada --icons nerd --images halfblocks --demo tagmenu ~/projects/demo"
Enter
Sleep 2s
Show
Sleep 2500ms
Screenshot "docs/screenshots/tag-menu.png"
Sleep 1s
